    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφορτ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>discharge one's
				cargo,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν γόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					21.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>jettison,</i> abs., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.413
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ θαλάσσῃ τὰ περιττὰ τῶν φορτίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timae.
					61
				</span></i>
			; <i>unload one's stomach,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.26
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιττώματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.40
			</span></i>: generally, <i>jettison, get rid of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.434
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
